## Additional finding: workaround and UX issue

### Workaround
We got it working using the `${ENV_VAR}` expansion in `.mcp.json` headers:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "my-server": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://my-mcp-server.example.com/mcp/",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer ${MY_TOKEN}"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

